<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49177" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trĭpŏlis</span></b> , is,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρίπολις</span> (prop.
		threetown), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the name of several districts of country and of
				towns.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A district of Thessaly</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 42,
				53, 6</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trĭpŏlĭtānus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>belonging to Tripolis</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					36, 10, 5</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A country of Africa</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Sol. 27</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trĭpŏlĭtānus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of
				Tripolis</i>, <i><span class="en">Eutr. 8,
			10</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A town of Phœnicia</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 12,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 5, 20, 17, §
			78</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A district of Laconia</i>, <i>near
				Tegea</i>, <i>including the cities of
			Belmina</i>, <i>Carystus</i>, <i>and
				Pellene</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 35, 27, 9</span></i>. — Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Trĭpŏlĭtĭcus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of
				Tripolis</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					14, 7, 9, § 74</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
